---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = { title: '跨境电商 — OUTGOPRO' };
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden page-hero">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none">
      <div class="page-orb page-orb-orange"></div>
      <div class="page-orb page-orb-amber"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-28 md:pb-20 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-widest font-bold uppercase rounded-full px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500/10 text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-300 border border-orange-400/20 mb-6">🛒 E-COMMERCE</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-6">
        <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-600 to-amber-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">不靠运气的增长。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">一夜爆单的故事很好听，但持续赚钱靠的是方法。选品、流量、履约——每一步都有逻辑。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 内容区 -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="space-y-20">

      <div class="content-block animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="content-icon">🏪</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">平台，选对战场。</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          大流量平台省心但利润薄，独立站自由但流量要自己搞，新兴渠道有红利但规则在变。没有最好的平台，只有最适合你现阶段的平台。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="content-icon">🔍</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">选品，数据说了算。</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          搜索量、竞争度、利润率——三个数字决定值不值得做。翻竞品差评，用户骂什么你就改什么。先小批量试，别一上来就赌身家。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="content-icon">📣</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">流量，精准比便宜重要。</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          付费投放看数据，内容营销看长期，红人合作看匹配度。最赚钱的不是新客，是老客户的复购。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="content-icon">📦</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">履约，最后一公里定生死。</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          妥投率、退货率、物流时效——这三个数字直接决定你的利润率和账号健康度。仓储选对了，睡觉都踏实。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-block animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="content-icon">🧮</div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4">利润公式</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          售价 − 采购 − 物流 − 平台费 − 广告 − 退货 ≥ 30% 毛利。<br/>低于这条线，就是在给平台打工。
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="page-cta-orange">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 md:py-20 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">想找到适合你的增长路径？</h2>
      <p class="text-orange-100 mb-8">从选品到履约，一起理清楚。</p>
      <a href="/about-us" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-orange-700 font-bold hover:bg-orange-50 hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all duration-300">联系我们 →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff7ed 0%, #ffedd5 40%, #fffbeb 100%); }
    :global(.dark) .page-hero { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #431407 50%, #0f172a 100%); }
    .page-orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(80px); opacity: 0.3; }
    :global(.dark) .page-orb { opacity: 0.1; }
    .page-orb-orange { width: 500px; height: 500px; background: radial-gradient(circle, #f97316, transparent 70%); top: -150px; right: -100px; }
    .page-orb-amber { width: 400px; height: 400px; background: radial-gradient(circle, #f59e0b, transparent 70%); bottom: -100px; left: -80px; }
    .content-block { max-width: 640px; }
    .content-block:nth-child(even) { margin-left: auto; text-align: right; }
    .content-block:nth-child(even) .content-icon { margin-left: auto; }
    .content-icon { width: 3rem; height: 3rem; font-size: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .page-cta-orange { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c 0%, #d97706 100%); }
    .animate-fade-in-up { animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) both; }
    @keyframes fadeInUp { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); } to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  </style>
</Layout>
